{"id":"n15299-1-8","stage":3,"title":"가만 · 且慢","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15299-1-8-1","ko":"아이고, 짐이 너무 무거워서 못 들겠네.","zh":"哎呀，这行李太重了，我拿不动呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이고,","meaning":"哎哟","explanation":"아이고：哎哟","readings":[{"term":"아이고","audio":"/audio/0d494eb3dbdffe834856.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71354","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이고","audio":"/audio/0d494eb3dbdffe834856.mp3"}},{"text":"짐이","meaning":"行李，货物","explanation":"짐：行李，货物；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"짐","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71357","senseId":"1","lemma":"짐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짐이","audio":"/audio/add0f4fadc4e9cc274b8.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"무거워서","meaning":"重，沉","explanation":"무겁다：重，沉；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"무겁다","audio":"/audio/91e3eab0a3ea6c9e4a4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58159","senseId":"1","lemma":"무겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무거워서","audio":"/audio/83d32f38f21fba641c8b.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"들겠네.","meaning":"带，提，拎","explanation":"들다：带，提，拎；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57293","senseId":"1","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들겠네","audio":"/audio/7d01ce4d45b96d6da5f8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0d494eb3dbdffe83","term":"아이고","zh":"哎哟","audio":"/audio/0d494eb3dbdffe834856.mp3","entryId":"71354","definition":"疼痛、辛苦、惊讶、生气时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아이고"]},{"id":"3d95bbb883f1e751","term":"짐","zh":"行李，货物","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3","entryId":"71357","definition":"为搬到他处而打包的物品。","pronunciation":["짐"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"91e3eab0a3ea6c9e","term":"무겁다","zh":"重，沉","audio":"/audio/91e3eab0a3ea6c9e4a4d.mp3","entryId":"58159","definition":"重量大。","pronunciation":["무겁따"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"带，提，拎","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"57293","definition":"手里拿着。","pronunciation":["들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d6ba7d067d448491c5a7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15299-1-8-2","ko":"가만 계세요. 제가 도와드릴게요.","zh":"请稍等，让我来帮您吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가만","meaning":"且慢，慢着","explanation":"가만：且慢，慢着","readings":[{"term":"가만","audio":"/audio/5d5206d7ceb96601aca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15299","senseId":"1","lemma":"가만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가만","audio":"/audio/5d5206d7ceb96601aca7.mp3"}},{"text":"계세요.","meaning":"待着（있다 的尊敬表达；가만 계세요：请别动）","explanation":"계시다：待着（있다 的尊敬表达；가만 계세요：请别动）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"계시다","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17749","senseId":"2","lemma":"계시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계세요","audio":"/audio/2a553f6887a157749fb2.mp3"}},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term"